    "release_payload": {
      "body": "# 1.6.0 \u2014 Tema escuro manual\n\nRegistro de vers\u00e3o do laborat\u00f3rio no GitHub. **Nenhum aplicativo ou patch foi distribu\u00eddo.**\n\n- Candidata aprovada: `v1.6.0-rc.1` (preservada).\n- Tag est\u00e1vel: `v1.6.0`.\n- C\u00f3digo aprovado: `1cb8f3ef72a0d21c11cfa3b2c0d51f7c8c769935`.\n- Aprova\u00e7\u00f5es verificadas nas contas: israelhudson e fahnassau30.\n- Comando final: israelhudson.\n- [Preview avaliado](https://israelhudson.github.io/flutter_code_push_example/snapshots/1cb8f3ef72a0d21c11cfa3b2c0d51f7c8c769935/).\n- [Relat\u00f3rio e execu\u00e7\u00e3o aprovados](https://github.com/israelhudson/flutter_code_push_example/actions/runs/37863610149).\n\n## Changelog aprovado\n\n- Merge pull request #17 from israelhudson/codex/manual-dark-theme\n- feat: adicionar tema escuro manual\n- Merge pull request #16 from israelhudson/codex/release-lab-backport\n- docs: registrar promo\u00e7\u00e3o real e provas da valida\u00e7\u00e3o\n- fix: identificar laborat\u00f3rio na candidata corrigida\n\nReviews de contas verificadas n\u00e3o demonstram independ\u00eancia das pessoas que operaram essas contas.\n\n<!-- release-lab-intent:efd1356279fe334ac9470a5d7f6c85c16fae31b339a54d8c86ab3d4c6db0ea76 -->\n<!-- release-lab-report:1ac71795e140ada599233af0132c8631d62a5f6c0a8a1975d52b5172d46c3469 -->\n",
